line	
line	<str>Go to the Waterfall Dungeon by boarding the log raft, using rope on the rock to the south, and finally using rope on the dead tree near the waterfall's edge to get to its entrance. [use games necklace to teleport to barbarian outpost for quick access to the waterfalls.]</str>
