line	<str>Speak to Alrena who is inside or just outside Edmond's house with purple dye and silk to get the Ardougne knight tabard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the tabard on the steel platebody to create an Ardougne knight platebody.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Ardougne Castle, wear the 3 steel items (Ardougne knight armour) and go downstairs. (You can have other equipment in the rest of the armour slots.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Elena through the cell door of the most northern cell.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Elena's house in East Ardougne (the house where you start Biohazard, immediately west of the log balance).</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the cabinet and take the thick clear liquid.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Ardougne Castle, talk to Elena.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Edmond.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Rehnison household in West Ardougne. It is on the north side of town, just west of the Mourner headquarters.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the bed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the dialogue with Elena and Councillor Halgrive.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the mourner gear. (To get a new set go downstairs in the mourner HQ, most top right building in west Ardougne. Kill a level 108 Mourner. You will need a Slayer ring to gain entry via the dark beasts teleport as the mourners won't allow entry without the set)</str>
line	
line	<str>West Ardougne tasks:</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the Ardougne knight helm, Ardougne knight platebody, and Ardougne knight platelegs/Steel platelegs. (You can have other equipment in the rest of the armour slots.)</str>
line	
line	<str>East Ardougne tasks:</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with Elena in the Rehnison household basement hideout to start The Battle of West Ardougne.</str>
line	
line	<str>Defeat the 10 Mourners at the Mourner headquarters.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the trapdoor in the north building.</str>
line	
line	<str>Defeat the 11 Mourners in the Mourner headquarters basement.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with Elena to start The Battle of East Ardougne.</str>
line	
line	<str>Defeat the 15 Knights of Ardougne and Paladins in the castle. (some are upstairs)</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to King Lathas.</str>
line	
line	<str>Watch the cutscene to its completion</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Arianwyn after being transported to Lletya.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Ysgawyn on the upper middle platform in Lletya.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Elena in the south-west corner in Lletya, near the pond.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Arianwyn located at the quest icon just north of the bank in Lletya.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Arianwyn once the meeting has finished.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Waterfall Dungeon by boarding the log raft, using rope on the rock to the south, and finally using rope on the dead tree near the waterfall's edge to get to its entrance. [use games necklace to teleport to barbarian outpost for quick access to the waterfalls.]</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the eastern room and search the northernmost crates for the key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the western room and past the two doors.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Arianwyn .</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the "Ode to eternity" book</str>
line	
line	<str>Inspect each pillar and then use the items in order on the pillars, the number of each pillar is different for everyone.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Lletya.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Arianwyn.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Elena near the pond.</str>
line	
line	<str>Plant the Cadantine seed in the nearby farming patch. (Note: if you have unlocked Barbarian Farming, you do not need a Seed dibber.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with Baxtorian in the central building, north of the bank, and ask how to find Lord Amlodd to get a crystal seed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Ask how to find Lady Trahaearn to receive her clue.</str>
line	
line	<str>Bring the crystal seed to Eluned, found just south of Lletya Archery Shop, north of the pond.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel north of Lletya to the cave entrance of the Underground Pass, accessible from the east side of Tirannwn, and go inside.</str>
line	
line	<str>Walk south of the Well of Voyage and inspect the blocked crevice.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a pickaxe to break through the crevice and enter.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the hammer and runite bar to fix the exoskeleton of the Elderly Elf.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Lady Tangwen Trahaearn.</str>
line	
line	<str>Rub the crystal seed, taking you to the Enchanted Valley.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the Mysterious Figure and choose any option to return with Lord Ieuan Amlodd to Lletya.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Elena and get the elder cadantine.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Arianwyn</col> to get the <col=800000>old crystal</col>.</col>
