done	<str>Talk to Arianwyn.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to Elena near the pond.</str>
done	
done	<str>Plant the Cadantine seed in the nearby farming patch. (Note: if you have unlocked Barbarian Farming, you do not need a Seed dibber.)</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak with Baxtorian in the central building, north of the bank, and ask how to find Lord Amlodd to get a crystal seed.</str>
done	
done	<str>Ask how to find Lady Trahaearn to receive her clue.</str>
done	
done	<str>Bring the crystal seed to Eluned, found just south of Lletya Archery Shop, north of the pond.</str>
done	
done	<str>Travel north of Lletya to the cave entrance of the Underground Pass, accessible from the east side of Tirannwn, and go inside.</str>
done	
done	<str>Walk south of the Well of Voyage and inspect the blocked crevice.</str>
done	
done	<str>Use a pickaxe to break through the crevice and enter.</str>
done	
done	<str>Use the hammer and runite bar to fix the exoskeleton of the Elderly Elf.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to Lady Tangwen Trahaearn.</str>
done	
done	<str>Rub the crystal seed, taking you to the Enchanted Valley.</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak to the Mysterious Figure and choose any option to return with Lord Ieuan Amlodd to Lletya.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to Elena and get the elder cadantine.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to Arianwyn to get the old crystal.</str>
done	
done	<str>Use the pestle and mortar on the crystal to get crystal dust.</str>
done	
done	<str>Use the elder cadantine on a vial of water to create the elder cadantine potion (unf).</str>
done	
done	<str>Use the crystal dust on the unfinished potion to create the inversion potion.</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak to Arianwyn.</str>
done	
done	<str>Return to Lletya, and speak with Arianwyn.</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak with Baxtorian. Be sure you ask about how to find BOTH Lord Crwys and Lady Hefin or else the option to chop the tree and jump on the skipping stones will not appear.</str>
done	
done	<str>Exit Lletya and run south past the magic trees and continue until you reach the Poison Waste. Cross stepping stones until you reach Lady Hefin (initially Elf Hermit). Talk to her.</str>
done	
done	<str>Go to the western side of Isafdar, south of the Iorwerth Camp, use the Iorwerth camp teleport to get there quickly. Be cautious as Iorwerth elves will attack you now. Pass the log balance and the stick trap south-west of it to get to the clearing. Then chop the dead tree north of the pond, directly west of the stick trap. Lord Crwys will appear, you'll automatically speak with him.</str>
done	
done	<str>Return to Lletya and speak with Baxtorian.</str>
done	
done	<str>Equip yourself with combat gear and go to the Iorwerth Camp.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the cave on the north side of camp, and slay the two guards within. You can trap the warrior behind the archer and kill them one at a time, taking no damage as long as you use the correct protection prayers.</str>
done	
done	<str>Search the chest and receive the orb of light.</str>
done	
done	<str>Return to Lletya and speak with Baxtorian.</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak with Elena near the pond.</str>
done	
done	<str>Exit out of Lletya's entrance north-west.</str>
done	
done	<str>Inspect the mushrooms near the entrance.</str>
done	
done	<str>Follow the footsteps, inspecting rocks, mushrooms and lamps along the way. They should lead you to a spot near the whiteberry spawn in the centre of Isafdar.</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak with Ysgawyn.</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the house to the south and search the east table to find Eoin.</str>
done	
done	<str>Go up the ladder and search the Cooking Pots by the South Cooking Range to find Iona.</str>
done	
done	<str>You will now have to fight Arianwyn.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to Baxtorian to receive a clue scroll.</str>
done	
done	<str>Search Lletya for the five glowing symbols on the walls:</str>
done	
done	<str>Take the limestone bricks, hammer, and saw, and build the statue in the centre of the village. (Make sure to finish the dialogue or you won't be able to continue the next part)</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak with Lady Ithell at her statue on Lletya.</str>
done	
done	<str>Bank the hammer/saw and get the rest of your supplies now. (You will still need your spade!)</str>
done	
done	<str>Go to the south of Isafdar, near the swamp, and dig there. (see picture)</str>
done	
done	<str>Dig two steps north of the STASH unit near Zul-Andra (BJS and run east, 76 Agility OR Zul-andra teleport OR charter a ship to Port Tyras and run South East)</str>
done	
done	<str>Dig outside the south gates of Prifddinas (Iorwerth camp teleport)</str>
done	
done	<str>Spin outside the western entry to the Underground Pass with nothing equipped (Teleport Crystal to Lletya).</str>
done	
done	<str>Bank now if you did not bring combat gear</str>
done	
done	<str>Enter the Underground Pass from the Isafdar side, and enter the Well of voyage. Proceed south along the winding path (see dungeon map for path) from Iban chamber to stairs, eventually travelling through a cave to dwarf camp at the ground level.</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak with Baxtorian.</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak with Elena.</str>
done	
done	<str>Fill the seven holes outside of the camp with the Explosive potions.</str>
done	
done	<str>Speak with Baxtorian.</str>
done	
done	<str>Defend the Dwarf camp for four minutes.</str>
done	
done	<str>Defeat Essyllt.</str>
done	
done	<str>After a cutscene, you will automatically enter the Temple of Light. If you are not equipped for this fight immediately teleport out, you can re-enter the Temple of Light through the Underground Pass, through the same crack that you entered the Dwarven camp with.</str>
done	
done	<str>Defeat the Fragment of Seren.</str>
done	
done	<str>After defeating the Fragment of Seren, Baxtorian will invite you into Prifddinas.</str>
